# Photo Wall common PXE tree filename policy for tftpd-hpa.
#
# Rules are evaluated top-to-bottom.  The deny rules run before the one
# permitted rewrite, so a serial prefix cannot hide an unsafe path.

# The common tree is read-only.  Refuse every TFTP PUT (WRQ) request.
aP ^.*$

# Refuse absolute names, traversal components, and Windows path separators.
aG ^/
aG (^|/)\.\.(/|$)
aG [\\]

# Raspberry Pi's default serial prefix is one 8-hex directory.  Remove one
# leading prefix for RRQ (GET) requests and leave all other path components
# unchanged.  Do not use `g`: a second prefix must not be stripped.
rG ^[[:xdigit:]]{8}/(.*)$ \1
